Arrows are pointing left, right, and center.

53
00:03:35,340 --> 00:03:36,900
This chaos is dangerous.

54
00:03:37,620 --> 00:03:41,940
In the exam room, when you are nervous, your eyes won't know where to look next.

55
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:45,800
This leads to hesitation and long pauses when you speak.

56
00:03:46,380 --> 00:03:50,680
You will stutter with um and ah while searching for your next point.

57
00:03:51,500 --> 00:03:55,300
