65
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:24,040
Then move to the problem, no internet or games, and finish with the result, focused better.

66
00:04:24,400 --> 00:04:26,420
This structure guides your eyes naturally.

67
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:31,800
